EN:
Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} can I get a minute?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}The truth is,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I've been thinking it's
about time for me to leave this
place behind.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}It's not that I've started to hate
{{TAG:0005:0006:}} or anything though.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's actually pretty nice here!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}That's why I'm thinking I gotta bust
out of this lukewarm place and{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
harden myself up again! {{TAG:0003:0007:}}GRAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}I've already picked a day too.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
