EN:
We're deep into autumn now.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I bet all you think about are the
piles of leaves all over{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Well, I find myself getting very
sentimental this time of year.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}If I were gonna equate life to some
sort of journey,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} then {{TAG:0005:0006:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
would just be a stop along my path!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I'm thinking it's about time I
moved on to a new town.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}I've decided to move on the {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}}
of next month.{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0028000F001500}}
Don't go!
Have a safe trip!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Amazing how fast a year goes by.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
December goes by the fastest.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Everyone has somewhere to be.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I've been stressing about the fact
that I can't just keep wasting my
time anymore.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}I think I'll get a fresh start on things
and move to a new town!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} of next month sounds as
good a day as any to hit the road!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0028000F001500}}
No, don't move!
Sounds like a plan.

